{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":5895,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793330527749,"status":"ok","value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2000,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k8yQh8liBbeukQusEvx6BjJowR1.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"367276","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Fooly Cooly","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Naota is a detached sixth-grader afflicted by the pangs of puberty. When a crazed girl on a motor scooter runs him over and brains him with a bass guitar his life gets weird - giant-fighting-robots-shooting-from-his-skull weird.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-04-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5RGOThoZphTkL1l4BMismezLbl5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5RGOThoZphTkL1l4BMismezLbl5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/5895/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"367277","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Fire Starter","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Naota’s attacker, Haruko, is now his dad’s live-in housemaid and she says she’s an alien. Mamimi names the robot from Naota’s head Canti, the God of Flame. Does Canti have anything to do with the mysterious fires burning all over town?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-06-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.1,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fNl5RMhBJ4GwPxFXhYLcs4Uw38N.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fNl5RMhBJ4GwPxFXhYLcs4Uw38N.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/5895/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"367278","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Marquis de Carabas","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The president of Naota’s class, Ninamori, is no stranger to the dirty deeds of politics. She rigs the vote to cast him as the lead role of their class play. But she gets in over her head after a crashing introduction to Haruko.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-08-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rGOJnEWqTEXFlBPjY8ORG7pUKxz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rGOJnEWqTEXFlBPjY8ORG7pUKxz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/5895/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"367279","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Full Swing","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"There’s a guy claiming to know Haruko and why she’s using Naota’s head as a portal for oversized battling robots. It’s too late, though, as a malfunctioning satellite is heading straight for them and it’s up to Naota to stop it!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-10-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bwWtZtWcLj6Jq0aT0IREtplcWiG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bwWtZtWcLj6Jq0aT0IREtplcWiG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/5895/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"367280","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Brittle Bullet","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Jealousy spurs an epic pellet gun battle between Naota and his dad over Haruko. The object of her desire will be revealed, and she’ll do whatever it takes to get him!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2000-12-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"rating":7.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zipcQSvhlWAV1GJMnClw2evSFwc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zipcQSvhlWAV1GJMnClw2evSFwc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/5895/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"367282","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber